%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Receptionist
    participant UI as MembershipPage
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as subsController
    participant S as subscriptionsService
    participant DB as Prisma / PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Select next plan and confirm actual collection
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/subscriptions/:id/renew
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate, checkFacilityScope, authorize(MANAGER, RECEPTIONIST), validate request
    alt request guard rejects
        API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 error
    else request accepted
        API->>C: renewSubscription(req, res, next)
        activate C
        C->>S: renewSubscription(id, data, creatorId)
        activate S
        S->>DB: Read source subscription, member and target paid plan, lock member and inspect purchase matrix
        activate DB
        DB-->>S: Requested records and validation context
        deactivate DB
        S->>S: Same tier starts at exact current end, downgrade cannot start before current end
        S->>S: Upgrade may be immediate or scheduled, reject additional paid queue and invalid future start
        alt source or plan missing, inactive member or purchase policy conflict
            S-->>C: 400 / 404 / 409
        else business conditions satisfied
            S->>DB: Transaction creates next subscription and SUCCESS payment including planId, then invoice
            activate DB
            DB-->>S: Saved result
            deactivate DB
            S-->>C: New period with correct ACTIVE / SCHEDULED state
        end
        deactivate S
        C-->>API: response or next(error)
        deactivate C
        API-->>UI: 201 result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show result or actionable error

%% Request validation schemas (see route evidence): RenewSubscriptionSchema
